<title>UK: HSBC yr profit rises.</title>
<headline>HSBC yr profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December, 1996</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  117.61	     vs 94.01</p>
<p> Dividend  (pence)	  26		   vs N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   41		   vs 32</p>
<p> Pretax			 4.52 bln	   vs 3.67 bln</p>
<p> Operating result	   4.52 bln	   vs 3.77 BLN</p>
<p> Bad/doubtful debt charge 384		  vs 352</p>
<p> Total assets		 236.55 bln	 vs 226.82 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 4.48 and 4.68 billion stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
